letter~
This must be a letter that the Prince was about to read when he was so
brutally interrupted. It reads...

"Hail, Prince of the Drow.
 My Master is willing to grant your beg. He will keep the Key safely under
 His own control, so that you will be relieved of such a task.
 So did my Master spoke.
 
 Lord Kalas."
~
