r$c0008a$c0007f$c0015fica  d$c0007i ven$c0015to?  $c0007No$c0015ti  che il $c0008g$c0007l$c0015ifo e$c0007' $c0008r$c0007ipetu$c0015to  ide$c0008n$c0007tico
$c0015su$c0008l$c0007la port$c0015a e s$c0007u u$c0015na $c0008m$c0007attone$c0015lla de$c0008l$c0007 muro$c0015.$c0007
