#18274
The Room of Magical Arts~
 You are standing in a large room, full of scrolls and inkwells, arcane
runes and the like. Large, oaken tables line the walls, cluttered with 
unfinished scrolls and alchemical experiments. Over in one corner of the
room, a circle of candles containing a chalked pentacle lie undisturbed, a
circle of summoning. Large portraits of past mages unleashing powerful
dweomercraft upon their foes hang on the walls, as do strange words of advice
for powerful spells.
~
